  "notes": [
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-file-new-0000001111845090#section64225232",
      "text": "客户端或服务器向AppGallery Connect上传相关文件接口。接口调用者的角色：账号持有者、管理员、APP管理员、运营。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-file-new-0000001111845090#section64225232",
      "text": "浏览器或客户端与服务器之间的接口协议采用HTTPS，Content-Type采用application/octet-stream格式，文件使用application/octet-stream格式编码添加到HTTPS报文中。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-file-new-0000001111845090#section64225232",
      "text": "此接口当前支持上传的应用软件包包括APK、AAB、RPK、APP（HarmonyOS应用/元服务）、EXE（Windows应用）。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用约束",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-file-new-0000001111845090#section132mcpsimp",
      "text": "文件大小上限： APK：不超过4GB。 RPK：快应用不超过20MB，快游戏不超过30MB。 AAB：不超过150MB。 APP（HarmonyOS应用/元服务）: HarmonyOS应用不超过4GB，元服务不超过10M。 EXE（Windows应用）: 不超过4GB。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用约束",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-file-new-0000001111845090#section132mcpsimp",
      "text": "APK：不超过4GB。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用约束",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-file-new-0000001111845090#section132mcpsimp",
      "text": "RPK：快应用不超过20MB，快游戏不超过30MB。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用约束",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-file-new-0000001111845090#section132mcpsimp",
      "text": "AAB：不超过150MB。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用约束",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-file-new-0000001111845090#section132mcpsimp",
      "text": "APP（HarmonyOS应用/元服务）: HarmonyOS应用不超过4GB，元服务不超过10M。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用约束",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-file-new-0000001111845090#section132mcpsimp",
      "text": "EXE（Windows应用）: 不超过4GB。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用约束",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-file-new-0000001111845090#section132mcpsimp",
      "text": "文件类型要求与获取上传文件地址中请求的文件名后缀相同。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用约束",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-file-new-0000001111845090#section132mcpsimp",
      "text": "用户头像需采用文件加密存储。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-file-new-0000001111845090#section7459173834010",
      "text": "请求Body为二进制形式的文件内容，对应Content-Type为application/octet-stream，文件的大小必须和获取文件上传地址时填写的contentLength一致。"
    },
    {
      "section": "响应参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-upload-file-new-0000001111845090#section46756188",
      "text": "接口返回的HTTP状态码为200时，表示文件上传成功。"
    }
  ],
